# LATE: wafer-compile: XLA SPMD partitioner helper failed with exit code 42
# NO-MARKER: wafer-compile: XLA SPMD partitioner output is missing its partition marker
# MARKER-DIRECTORY: wafer-compile: XLA SPMD partitioner output is missing its partition marker
# HELPER-ROOT-SYMLINK: wafer-compile: helper output is not a real directory
# RESIDUAL-SDY: wafer-compile: XLA SPMD partitioner output still contains Shardy semantics
